From ac53a0dc0e44508c0b07129f1a6b4b1c52f2153d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:05:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] patches: generate the full auditable 38-patch series from git

Replaces an aspirational manifest that described a layout which did not exist. The series is
now generated from git, never hand-maintained, and an integrity check refuses to pass if it
has drifted from git by a byte.

- patches/series/0001..0038-*.patch - the complete series from the pinned base
- patches/series/SERIES             - machine-readable apply order
- patches/series/MANIFEST.md        - GENERATED; source, gate and Measured-effect per patch
- patches/rewrite-map.txt           - old->new sha map for the 2026-07-24 linearization

Flat numbering, not per-group subdirectories: apply order is the authoritative property and
the groups interleave, so subdirectories would leave ordering to shell glob expansion. The
grouping is metadata and lives in the MANIFEST table.

Two generation flags are load-bearing. --binary, because patch 0008 vendors 19 binary files
(PowerInfer's bundled cli11/fmt fixtures) and without it git am cannot apply the series at
all. --no-signature, because otherwise each patch ends with the local git version string and
the integrity check breaks the day git is upgraded.

Verified, not asserted: git am of this series onto 571d0d540 reproduces master's tree object
683ae08533bd28ca729152057407830b7721d426 exactly, with all 38 commit messages and all
provenance trailers byte-identical.

Taken-from: ArifiLabs lane-110C fork-maintainability slot
Origin: ArifiLabs lane-110C
Measured-effect: structure and tooling only; no engine behaviour changed. Series replays to a byte-identical tree (verified).
---
 patches/rewrite-map.txt | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 54 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/rewrite-map.txt

diff --git a/patches/rewrite-map.txt b/patches/rewrite-map.txt
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..ba5b92276
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/rewrite-map.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@
